 "file": "_sownb/vb/REVIEW_RUN9.md",
 "subject": "run 9's own coverage artefact, written 2026-09-01 21:55 by tools it ran itself. It says content covered 140, remaining 276, 12 waves - and its slot lists already contain the eleven wave-3 decks, which were in the working tree at the time. Run 9 reported 147 covered and then projected 158 'after the eleven'. Both are wrong: the base was 7 above this instrument and the +11 was already inside it. Re-running the same two scripts today reproduces 140 exactly.",
